<title>USA: Superior Energy buys Dimensional.</title>
<headline>Superior Energy buys Dimensional.</headline>
<dateline>BELLE CHASSE, La. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Energy Services Inc said on Monday it has completed the previously announced purchase of all the stock of Dimensional Oilfield Services Inc of Belle Chasse, La., for $2.5 million cash and 1.0 million shares of common stock of Superior Energy.</p>
<p>Dimensional Oilfield Services provides offshore well plug and abandonment services in the Gulf of Mexico, Superior said.</p>
